WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:00.160 --> 00:01.940
I'm impressed by the kid.

4
00:02.110 --> 00:03.460
I want to get to know him better.

5
00:03.520 --> 00:04.630
Whatever floats your boat.

6
00:04.940 --> 00:05.970
Not my type.

7
00:06.020 --> 00:07.730
Happy Birthday, Instructor Thear.

8
00:08.200 --> 00:10.070
I told you I'd take care of this one myself.

9
00:10.990 --> 00:12.510
So why the hell are you trying to steal him from me?

10
00:12.540 --> 00:13.840
Stop fighting already.

11
00:14.190 --> 00:15.370
You guys are friends, dammit.

12
00:15.400 --> 00:16.470
I'm not his friend.

13
00:16.490 --> 00:19.440
And I'll do whatever it takes to beat you.

14
00:19.540 --> 00:20.380
Master.

15
00:20.450 --> 00:21.920
I want him to love me.

16
00:22.290 --> 00:23.920
There might be a way.

17
00:23.950 --> 00:25.700
But are you willing to trade

18
00:25.720 --> 00:30.090
all the good luck you'll ever have in your life

19
00:30.120 --> 00:31.410
for him?

20
03:13.150 --> 03:14.740
Please root for me,

21
03:15.040 --> 03:15.970
honey.

22
03:40.250 --> 03:43.070
(Yin as Theartha)

23
03:47.890 --> 03:50.580
(War as Mungkorn)

24
03:55.130 --> 03:57.170
(Shane as Phuwin)

25
03:57.740 --> 04:00.670
(Boss as Lukplub)

26
04:03.110 --> 04:04.780
(Kit as Kanin)

27
04:05.110 --> 04:07.010
(Tang as Nadol)

28
04:10.490 --> 04:15.710
(Tae as Saming)

29
04:44.960 --> 04:46.970
Why did you bring me here?

30
04:48.890 --> 04:52.780
Like I told you, if you want to get ahead in your career,

31
04:53.470 --> 04:54.740
there's a shortcut.

32
04:55.860 --> 04:58.680
A shortcut? What kind of shortcut?

33
04:59.910 --> 05:01.350
Do you trust me?

34
05:01.680 --> 05:05.430
I mean, seeing how well you're doing, of course I do.

35
05:06.200 --> 05:07.720
If you trust me,

36
05:08.620 --> 05:10.340
you have to do exactly as I say,

37
05:11.850 --> 05:15.080
and your life will never be the same again.

38
05:59.480 --> 06:02.740
(Have this when you wake up to help with your hangover.)

39
06:36.260 --> 06:38.650
(I've ironed a cool outfit for you.)

40
07:09.340 --> 07:13.580
(I've prepared warm water for you. Enjoy your bath, Thear.)

41
07:19.410 --> 07:20.330
Master,

42
07:21.280 --> 07:22.810
I've brought him here.

43
07:23.150 --> 07:24.890
He's the one I told you about,

44
07:24.920 --> 07:26.820
the one who wanted to have a ritual performed with you

45
07:27.190 --> 07:29.140
to help him get ahead in his career.

46
07:30.520 --> 07:32.350
With looks like these...

47
07:33.830 --> 07:35.820
I understand why.

48
07:37.030 --> 07:39.080
What do my looks have to do with anything?

49
07:39.100 --> 07:40.010
Well...

50
07:41.130 --> 07:42.990
He probably means...

51
07:43.340 --> 07:45.570
you don't look much like a cop.

52
07:51.650 --> 07:53.010
Come closer.

53
07:56.280 --> 07:58.640
Are you doing it, too?

54
07:58.860 --> 08:00.460
I thought you'd already done it.

55
08:00.560 --> 08:02.170
I've done it, but I can do it again.

56
08:02.810 --> 08:04.820
It'll make my luck even stronger.

57
08:11.840 --> 08:13.130
Hold his hand.

58
08:18.720 --> 08:19.490
Mungkorn,

59
08:19.870 --> 08:21.220
if you want your mom to have a better life

60
08:22.440 --> 08:24.010
and want to get promoted,

61
08:24.780 --> 08:26.200
you have to trust me.

62
08:28.540 --> 08:29.260
Okay?

63
08:31.420 --> 08:32.420
Okay.

64
09:03.190 --> 09:04.340
Saming...

65
09:05.270 --> 09:07.660
I have a really bad feeling about this.

66
09:08.230 --> 09:09.970
I think we should stop here.

67
09:10.280 --> 09:11.360
We can't, Mungkorn.

68
09:12.130 --> 09:13.320
We're already here.

69
09:13.870 --> 09:15.180
If you quit halfway,

70
09:15.700 --> 09:17.090
it'll bring a curse upon you.

71
09:20.580 --> 09:22.530
Please stop. I'm leaving.

72
10:04.890 --> 10:09.040
I have commanded his soul to be infatuated with you.

73
10:09.100 --> 10:15.860
All that remains is for you to unite your body

74
10:16.680 --> 10:18.520
with his.

75
10:18.900 --> 10:24.860
Then Mungkorn will be bound to you as your soulmate for eternity.

76
10:47.410 --> 10:48.100
Mungkorn...

77
10:49.380 --> 10:50.240
Are you okay?

78
10:51.260 --> 10:52.380
I am.

79
10:54.090 --> 10:57.600
I'm glad you agreed to go through with the ritual.

80
10:58.640 --> 10:59.620
From now on,

81
11:00.070 --> 11:02.690
your life will only get better,

82
11:03.010 --> 11:04.440
both in your career

83
11:06.880 --> 11:08.170
and your love life.

84
11:09.910 --> 11:13.580
Thank you for caring so much about me.

85
11:14.210 --> 11:16.100
I've cared about you all this time.

86
11:16.830 --> 11:18.170
You just never noticed.

87
11:19.580 --> 11:20.910
I'm sorry.

88
11:28.720 --> 11:30.330
The Golden Face Blessing ritual is actually good.

89
11:30.380 --> 11:32.810
The master said it boosts your energy.

90
11:33.230 --> 11:35.580
Whatever you do, people will feel compassion for you

91
11:36.090 --> 11:37.360
and take a liking to you.

92
11:37.690 --> 11:40.150
Oh, if it's about making people like me,

93
11:40.830 --> 11:42.080
I don't need that.

94
11:43.470 --> 11:46.160
As long as you love me, that's more than enough.

95
11:46.500 --> 11:50.210
You even brought me to Chiang Mai for a ritual with a renowned master.

96
11:51.680 --> 11:52.730
Actually, this shrine...

97
11:52.750 --> 11:54.510
handles both white and black magic.

98
11:54.540 --> 11:55.890
A lot of police officers come here.

99
11:55.920 --> 11:57.160
Many of them practice the occult.

100
11:57.440 --> 11:59.280
Some get sacred tattoos for invulnerability.

101
11:59.300 --> 12:00.700
Others come to enhance their luck.

102
12:00.740 --> 12:02.230
Some even perform love spells.

103
12:04.120 --> 12:07.340
Well, you don't need any love spells.

104
12:08.100 --> 12:10.390
I'm already head over heels for you.

105
12:10.860 --> 12:12.280
If I didn't have you,

106
12:12.440 --> 12:14.000
how would I even survive?

107
12:14.430 --> 12:17.650
You wouldn't, and I wouldn't let you live without me.

108
12:41.090 --> 12:42.620
Wow.

109
12:43.440 --> 12:45.410
A romantic khantoke dinner?

110
12:46.050 --> 12:47.910
What version of Theartha is this?

111
12:47.940 --> 12:51.850
Obviously, it's the crazy-in-love one.

112
12:53.000 --> 12:54.560
Isn't this a bit much?

113
12:54.760 --> 12:56.070
Well, it's not just that.

114
12:56.100 --> 12:58.180
You see, Mungkorn prepared everything

115
12:58.210 --> 13:00.070
for me this morning,

116
13:00.450 --> 13:03.440
so I wanted to give him a little surprise, too.

117
13:04.370 --> 13:05.210
Is this enough?

118
13:05.230 --> 13:06.960
Will there be a traditional dance performance?

119
13:07.280 --> 13:08.820
Hey, how did you know about that?

120
13:09.040 --> 13:10.380
I've kept it a secret.

121
13:10.520 --> 13:11.840
I'll give you a little sneak peek.

122
13:12.020 --> 13:13.180
Just a teaser.

123
13:13.890 --> 13:21.260
♪Swaying gently, swaying along, nice and easy as we go♪

124
13:21.290 --> 13:23.690
I guess love really does make people lose their minds.

125
13:24.910 --> 13:25.680
What?

126
13:26.160 --> 13:27.400
I'd better get going.

127
13:31.590 --> 13:32.470
Thear.

128
13:33.290 --> 13:34.370
He's a good one.

129
13:35.350 --> 13:36.880
You've changed yourself so much for him.

130
13:39.410 --> 13:41.090
Make sure you don't let him go.

131
13:48.170 --> 13:49.960
♪Swaying gently...♪

132
14:31.900 --> 14:33.590
Oh, honey.

133
14:35.790 --> 14:37.600
Why are you home so late?

134
14:38.480 --> 14:41.720
I've been waiting for you for so long I'm about to drift off to sleep.

135
14:43.450 --> 14:44.890
I was working.

136
14:45.830 --> 14:46.630
It's okay.

137
14:46.970 --> 14:48.840
I'd wait a lifetime for you.

138
14:49.970 --> 14:51.080
Come here.

139
14:53.400 --> 14:54.590
Stand right there for a second.

140
14:57.110 --> 14:58.120
Please take a seat.

141
15:01.780 --> 15:03.150
Aren't you even a little happy?

142
15:03.560 --> 15:05.930
Here, I arranged a special khantoke set

143
15:06.060 --> 15:07.710
just for my special someone.

144
15:08.210 --> 15:10.290
It's all from the most famous spots in Chiang Mai.

145
15:10.860 --> 15:14.050
You prepared everything for me this morning,

146
15:14.650 --> 15:16.840
so I wanted to take care of you, too.

147
15:18.220 --> 15:19.840
Here's the first bite.

148
15:20.700 --> 15:21.990
Served right to you.

149
15:22.970 --> 15:23.620
Open wide.

150
15:24.140 --> 15:25.580
I've already had dinner.

151
15:32.920 --> 15:35.160
Oh, and how did you get home?

152
15:35.420 --> 15:37.540
Why didn't you call me?

153
15:38.000 --> 15:39.080
I could've picked you up.

154
15:39.170 --> 15:40.670
Saming gave me a ride.

155
15:41.260 --> 15:41.960
What?

156
15:43.570 --> 15:46.430
Hey, you let him bring you here?

157
15:46.830 --> 15:48.310
Then he knows we're living together.

158
15:48.890 --> 15:50.010
It's fine.

159
15:50.830 --> 15:52.120
I trust him.

160
15:52.340 --> 15:53.940
But I don't.

161
15:54.170 --> 15:55.530
That's your problem, Inspector.

162
16:02.600 --> 16:03.600
Hey, wait.

163
16:04.560 --> 16:05.560
You could at least eat some.

164
16:05.590 --> 16:06.860
I ordered so much food.

165
16:07.140 --> 16:08.380
I'm not hungry.

166
16:16.870 --> 16:17.660
Mungkorn...

167
16:36.040 --> 16:36.840
Hey.

168
16:37.580 --> 16:39.190
You took your ring off.

169
16:39.310 --> 16:40.330
You probably forgot to wear it.

170
16:42.270 --> 16:43.430
You should wear it while you're at home.

171
16:45.210 --> 16:46.380
I don't want to wear it.

172
16:48.720 --> 16:49.510
It's tight

173
16:50.700 --> 16:51.850
and uncomfortable.

174
16:53.410 --> 16:54.650
Is something wrong?

175
16:55.870 --> 16:57.560
Did I do something wrong?

176
16:58.440 --> 16:59.680
Nothing's wrong.

177
17:00.600 --> 17:01.860
I'm just tired.

178
17:05.140 --> 17:06.920
Is there anything I can help you with?

179
17:10.110 --> 17:11.200
Is it about work?

180
17:11.690 --> 17:13.990
The reason you let Saming drop you off

181
17:14.170 --> 17:17.400
is because you want to get close to him for the case, right?

182
17:18.570 --> 17:20.800
There's nothing to investigate about him.

183
17:22.570 --> 17:23.860
I was just mistaken.

184
17:24.930 --> 17:26.200
What do you mean by that?

185
17:26.720 --> 17:30.130
You're acting really strange today.

186
17:31.350 --> 17:33.470
Is something on your mind? You can tell me.

187
17:34.210 --> 17:36.040
Or are you putting on some kind of act?

188
17:36.650 --> 17:38.140
I really can't keep up with you.

189
17:38.550 --> 17:40.390
I'm not putting on an act.

190
17:41.570 --> 17:44.760
I'm just doing exactly what I want to.

191
17:45.470 --> 17:46.500
Or maybe...

192
17:47.010 --> 17:49.630
Is it this?

193
17:56.770 --> 17:58.730
There's no wiretap or anything like that.

194
18:00.110 --> 18:02.330
Stop thinking the worst of Saming.

195
18:07.280 --> 18:09.110
I don't know what's gotten into you,

196
18:09.630 --> 18:12.100
but there's no way I'll ever trust Saming.

197
18:14.900 --> 18:16.540
I'll prove to you

198
18:16.750 --> 18:18.740
what his true colors are.

199
18:42.130 --> 18:44.000
What kind of coffee do you like?

200
18:44.600 --> 18:46.130
I like it strong.

201
18:46.870 --> 18:48.030
No sugar.

202
18:48.970 --> 18:50.750
I don't really like it sweet.

203
18:51.450 --> 18:52.340
That's perfect.

204
18:52.460 --> 18:53.980
I'll keep that in mind

205
18:54.410 --> 18:56.460
so I can make it for you every day.

206
19:00.480 --> 19:01.460
Here you go.

207
19:02.110 --> 19:03.360
Would you like a sandwich, too?

208
19:03.390 --> 19:04.550
I bought it for you.

209
19:04.570 --> 19:06.570
I'm telling you. It's amazing.

210
19:10.810 --> 19:11.880
Is it good?

211
19:12.270 --> 19:13.280
Very good.

212
19:14.380 --> 19:15.090
Wait.

213
19:15.940 --> 19:18.170
Your collar is a mess.

214
19:18.570 --> 19:19.800
Let me fix it for you.

215
19:23.970 --> 19:24.690
Oops!

216
19:25.480 --> 19:26.970
What's going on here?

217
19:26.990 --> 19:29.080
Am I missing some gossip?

218
19:29.360 --> 19:31.700
Hold on, are you two...

219
19:32.580 --> 19:33.790
dating?

220
19:34.020 --> 19:35.800
No, we're not dating.

221
19:36.250 --> 19:37.910
I'm still trying to win his heart.

222
19:38.980 --> 19:40.760
I don't know if he falls for me yet.

223
19:40.960 --> 19:43.910
How could I not fall for someone like you?

224
19:44.250 --> 19:48.180
Aw, you guys are cute.

225
19:50.310 --> 19:52.060
That's fabulous. Don't worry.

226
19:52.090 --> 19:55.500
Love is always a beautiful thing.

227
19:56.960 --> 19:58.220
What are you looking at?

228
19:58.250 --> 19:59.790
Have a crush on me?

229
20:01.690 --> 20:03.640
Hello, Inspector.

230
20:04.950 --> 20:08.520
See? You didn't make a move on Mungkorn,

231
20:09.000 --> 20:11.510
so someone else swooped right in and snatched him up.

232
20:29.190 --> 20:30.470
Don't you think it's weird?

233
20:31.390 --> 20:33.410
I know they're friends,

234
20:33.470 --> 20:35.020
but isn't this too much?

235
20:36.210 --> 20:37.220
I agree.

236
20:37.250 --> 20:39.580
That's not the look in Mungkorn's eyes that I remember.

237
20:40.640 --> 20:42.340
It's like he's a different person.

238
20:50.400 --> 20:51.350
Mungkorn,

239
20:52.020 --> 20:53.350
are you serious right now?

240
20:56.410 --> 20:57.450
Serious about what?

241
20:57.470 --> 20:58.770
About Saming, obviously.

242
21:00.040 --> 21:01.080
Enough already.

243
21:01.370 --> 21:02.470
I'm jealous.

244
21:02.610 --> 21:03.690
I really am.

245
21:04.040 --> 21:06.010
I don't know what else you want me to prove.

246
21:06.530 --> 21:08.450
I don't need you to prove anything

247
21:09.330 --> 21:10.220
because you...

248
21:10.830 --> 21:12.520
aren't even on my mind.

249
21:14.070 --> 21:16.210
I want to prove to everyone

250
21:16.370 --> 21:20.440
that Saming has nothing to do with the Black Bull.

251
21:22.330 --> 21:25.090
What did he do to make you change your mind suddenly?

252
21:25.210 --> 21:26.470
Overnight, to be exact.

253
21:27.270 --> 21:28.620
Well, tell me.

254
21:28.990 --> 21:30.390
What makes him better than me?

255
21:32.450 --> 21:33.880
Pretty much everything.

256
21:43.410 --> 21:47.080
But I am your legally wedded husband.

257
21:48.360 --> 21:49.700
So legally speaking,

258
21:50.550 --> 21:52.090
I can get a divorce, right?

259
21:54.130 --> 21:56.020
Because I want my own life back.

260
21:57.700 --> 21:59.270
Why would you say that?

261
22:00.550 --> 22:02.170
I'm just being honest.

262
22:17.950 --> 22:19.790
Did you have to push me that hard?

263
22:29.240 --> 22:32.170
You think something's off about Mungkorn, too, right?

264
22:32.900 --> 22:35.690
Yeah, he hasn't been himself lately.

265
22:36.960 --> 22:38.560
Something is definitely up.

266
22:38.810 --> 22:40.590
Don't take this the wrong way,

267
22:40.900 --> 22:42.250
but it's like...

268
22:42.280 --> 22:44.190
He's under some kind of spell, right?

269
22:46.450 --> 22:47.560
Why are you here?

270
22:49.170 --> 22:50.820
We came here for a trip,

271
22:51.120 --> 22:54.320
but we happened to run into Saming and Mungkorn

272
22:54.700 --> 22:56.100
at a black magic shrine

273
22:56.130 --> 22:57.590
that's popular with cops.

274
22:59.530 --> 23:00.220
Phuwin...

275
23:01.550 --> 23:02.630
Isn't that Mungkorn over there?

276
23:03.390 --> 23:05.710
How did Saming end up with Mungkorn?

277
23:06.810 --> 23:07.700
Mungkorn!

278
23:09.890 --> 23:10.730
Phuwin?

279
23:11.550 --> 23:13.190
I didn't expect to see you here.

280
23:13.670 --> 23:15.240
- I just came... - Well...

281
23:15.270 --> 23:17.130
I brought him here to pray.

282
23:21.550 --> 23:23.290
Right, Saming.

283
23:23.740 --> 23:25.380
This is Lukplub, my boyfriend.

284
23:25.920 --> 23:26.660
Hello.

285
23:26.870 --> 23:27.670
Hello.

286
23:28.840 --> 23:30.420
I heard your boyfriend was cute.

287
23:30.750 --> 23:32.690
Didn't think he'd be this cute in person.

288
23:33.530 --> 23:35.640
I brought Phuwin here for the Golden Face Blessing ritual.

289
23:36.420 --> 23:38.220
I was planning to drop by the station.

290
23:38.410 --> 23:40.560
I didn't expect to run into you here.

291
23:40.960 --> 23:42.090
What about the others?

292
23:42.610 --> 23:43.670
Where's Inspector Thear?

293
23:44.170 --> 23:45.420
He's just doing his thing.

294
23:46.130 --> 23:47.610
Why are you asking me about him?

295
23:53.200 --> 23:55.040
Should we grab a meal together sometime?

296
23:55.590 --> 23:56.950
I've been missing everyone.

297
23:57.090 --> 23:57.970
I'd rather not.

298
23:59.100 --> 24:00.710
I'm having dinner with Saming.

299
24:02.260 --> 24:04.500
(I think Mungkorn is definitely under a spell.)

300
24:06.250 --> 24:08.060
When did he start acting so weird?

301
24:08.870 --> 24:10.550
I'd say since yesterday.

302
24:11.680 --> 24:13.110
He gave me the cold shoulder when he got home.

303
24:13.400 --> 24:14.200
- What? - What?

304
24:14.770 --> 24:15.630
Wait a second.

305
24:16.540 --> 24:18.640
Why would Mungkorn be at your place?

306
24:25.170 --> 24:27.770
They are actually married.

307
24:29.860 --> 24:31.190
Mungkorn told me that.

308
24:31.970 --> 24:33.420
Hold on a second.

309
24:33.680 --> 24:35.070
Mungkorn is under a spell,

310
24:35.400 --> 24:36.830
and he's also married.

311
24:37.020 --> 24:38.310
I can't keep up with this.

312
24:40.730 --> 24:41.720
Here's what happened.

313
24:44.180 --> 24:47.730
My mom had me marry him

314
24:47.980 --> 24:49.340
to turn my luck around.

315
24:49.890 --> 24:51.600
I thought I'd just go along with it

316
24:51.630 --> 24:52.950
to put her mind at ease.

317
24:53.100 --> 24:55.050
We'd get divorced after six months.

318
24:57.350 --> 24:58.940
But as we lived together,

319
25:00.600 --> 25:02.450
I actually fell for him.

320
25:04.090 --> 25:05.250
I mean, look at him.

321
25:06.410 --> 25:07.880
How could I not fall for him?

322
25:08.570 --> 25:09.550
By now,

323
25:09.970 --> 25:11.900
he's become a part of my life.

324
25:20.440 --> 25:21.970
I figured as much.

325
25:23.060 --> 25:24.610
I've noticed it for a while now.

326
25:26.510 --> 25:28.950
Why did he tell you but not me, though?

327
25:29.200 --> 25:32.720
Well, maybe I'm more trustworthy than you.

328
25:35.180 --> 25:36.600
What the hell, Thear?

329
25:36.830 --> 25:38.380
You seriously kept this from me?

330
25:38.410 --> 25:40.580
Damn, I'm supposed to be your best friend.

331
25:41.040 --> 25:43.420
I trusted you to make sure no one would flirt with him,

332
25:43.490 --> 25:44.670
but you just took him for yourself.

333
25:47.330 --> 25:48.460
It's okay.

334
25:49.800 --> 25:53.120
We'll get Mungkorn back to his normal self.

335
25:53.270 --> 25:54.450
But first of all,

336
25:54.620 --> 25:57.280
he must come with us to have the spell removed.

337
25:57.670 --> 26:00.480
From the look of it, I doubt he'll come with us.

338
26:00.800 --> 26:02.590
He's infatuated with Saming.

339
26:04.960 --> 26:05.650
Hey.

340
26:07.410 --> 26:09.040
That oracle your mom asked for help...

341
26:10.160 --> 26:11.460
Will she be able to help?

342
26:29.560 --> 26:31.710
Is there any way you can help?

343
26:32.070 --> 26:35.110
Mungkorn has become a completely different person.

344
26:35.860 --> 26:37.420
The magic being used...

345
26:38.100 --> 26:39.500
is black magic.

346
26:40.720 --> 26:42.060
The longer it lasts,

347
26:42.390 --> 26:44.300
the more it will affect Mungkorn.

348
26:46.080 --> 26:48.340
The dark magic will eventually

349
26:48.930 --> 26:50.080
consume him,

350
26:50.450 --> 26:52.490
and he'll forget who you are.

351
26:55.400 --> 26:56.510
But don't be afraid.

352
26:57.010 --> 26:59.340
Your fates are still entwined.

353
27:00.350 --> 27:02.060
Luckily, he's stubborn.

354
27:02.900 --> 27:04.540
His soul is fighting it from within,

355
27:05.280 --> 27:06.780
calling out for only you.

356
27:07.990 --> 27:10.340
That means there's a way

357
27:10.370 --> 27:12.710
I can get my Mungkorn back, right?

358
27:13.770 --> 27:15.820
May the love you shared in a past life

359
27:16.150 --> 27:17.750
be awakened

360
27:18.190 --> 27:20.970
and brought back to you.

361
27:23.550 --> 27:25.180
Even if things

362
27:25.700 --> 27:27.340
can never be the same again,

363
27:28.280 --> 27:30.740
may the heaven and earth bear witness

364
27:32.230 --> 27:34.140
that you two

365
27:34.610 --> 27:35.860
are destined to be together,

366
27:36.500 --> 27:38.020
never to be parted.

367
27:48.030 --> 27:49.160
Sugar palm seeds?

368
27:51.900 --> 27:53.410
What else? This one?

369
27:56.860 --> 27:58.250
What can I get for you?

370
27:58.680 --> 28:01.150
Oh, I haven't seen you in ages!

371
28:01.270 --> 28:03.760
Wow, you two are still so in love.

372
28:03.870 --> 28:05.940
Are you going to book my place out again?

373
28:06.360 --> 28:07.570
Not today, thanks.

374
28:07.590 --> 28:09.580
We're in a rush. It's just a quick stop.

375
28:10.050 --> 28:13.650
I'll have the grass jelly, sugar palm seeds,

376
28:13.670 --> 28:16.220
and a mix of red and green syrups

377
28:16.250 --> 28:17.270
with lots of condensed milk, please.

378
28:17.290 --> 28:17.930
Two bowls.

379
28:17.960 --> 28:20.000
Coming right up.

380
28:20.610 --> 28:21.750
Just a moment.

381
28:21.770 --> 28:22.710
See?

382
28:23.080 --> 28:24.610
I even remembered your favorite recipe.

383
28:24.890 --> 28:26.020
You told me

384
28:26.050 --> 28:28.270
you were taking me on a routine inspection.

385
28:29.320 --> 28:31.230
Why did you bring me to a shaved ice place?

386
28:32.310 --> 28:34.410
We're supposed to be on duty.

387
28:37.330 --> 28:40.510
Just getting a little refreshment before work.

388
28:45.840 --> 28:51.280
(Shaved ice)

389
28:54.290 --> 28:55.310
Mungkorn,

390
28:55.800 --> 28:56.810
aren't you going to eat?

391
28:57.590 --> 28:59.290
Hey, this is your favorite.

392
29:00.430 --> 29:02.660
We were here together

393
29:03.280 --> 29:04.880
after you were discharged from the hospital.

394
29:04.990 --> 29:05.910
Don't you remember?

395
29:07.730 --> 29:09.170
You told me

396
29:09.200 --> 29:12.510
the shaved ice here made you feel so much better.

397
29:14.900 --> 29:16.260
You said it yourself.

398
29:35.710 --> 29:37.990
It's too sweet. I don't like it.

399
29:42.420 --> 29:43.180
Listen,

400
29:43.890 --> 29:45.600
we made a promise to each other

401
29:45.790 --> 29:47.450
that if we survived,

402
29:47.790 --> 29:49.990
we would have shaved ice here together.

403
29:50.710 --> 29:52.220
It means a lot to me,

404
29:53.050 --> 29:54.950
but if you can't remember, it's alright.

405
29:55.200 --> 29:56.950
I'll make you remember eventually.

406
29:57.530 --> 29:58.270
So...

407
29:59.040 --> 30:00.400
come on, let me feed you.

408
30:02.620 --> 30:03.320
Just one bite.

409
30:03.350 --> 30:04.780
I told you I don't like it.

410
30:06.620 --> 30:07.930
Is it too bland?

411
30:07.970 --> 30:09.500
Maybe I need to spice things up.

412
30:16.910 --> 30:18.490
I'll wait in the car.

413
30:18.950 --> 30:20.450
Once you're done,

414
30:21.160 --> 30:22.650
we can get back to work.

415
30:23.190 --> 30:26.490
(You must take him back to the places you've been before)

416
30:26.730 --> 30:29.420
(and do the things you used to do with him.)

417
30:29.440 --> 30:31.510
(Make him remember everything.)

418
30:31.810 --> 30:35.610
(Every sight, taste, scent, and sound.)

419
30:55.380 --> 30:57.010
Why did you bring me to a waterfall?

420
30:58.470 --> 30:59.610
Is there a case here?

421
31:00.810 --> 31:03.940
Yeah. This place is a campsite.

422
31:04.620 --> 31:06.300
There might be some drug deals going down.

423
31:08.020 --> 31:09.220
Oh, and this...

424
31:10.050 --> 31:12.050
is where we've been together before.

425
31:12.920 --> 31:13.770
Do you remember?

426
31:14.400 --> 31:15.930
You're asking me this again?

427
31:16.700 --> 31:18.410
Why do you want to know that so badly?

428
31:18.560 --> 31:19.830
I just want to do my job.

429
31:46.830 --> 31:48.490
- Whoa, hey! - Hey!

430
31:48.630 --> 31:49.170
Stop.

431
31:49.200 --> 31:51.370
(Please just let me be a good husband for once.)

432
31:53.960 --> 31:54.760
Mungkorn...

433
31:56.400 --> 31:58.150
You remember this place, don't you?

434
31:59.030 --> 32:01.190
This is where we came to swim

435
32:01.210 --> 32:02.310
and camp together.

436
32:06.060 --> 32:06.950
This...

437
32:07.870 --> 32:11.780
is where I made you feel so warm,

438
32:12.390 --> 32:14.330
like you were being showered with love from the whole world.

439
32:16.970 --> 32:19.200
Is it even possible for someone to feel that way?

440
32:19.840 --> 32:21.020
Of course it is.

441
32:21.650 --> 32:22.910
It's possible when you're in love.

442
33:00.650 --> 33:01.990
What are you trying to do?

443
33:04.920 --> 33:07.030
You remember everything about us now, right?

444
33:14.420 --> 33:15.650
I want to go home.

445
33:17.270 --> 33:18.280
Hey, wait.

446
33:19.850 --> 33:20.730
You know what?

447
33:20.760 --> 33:23.120
We should spend the night camping here together.

448
33:23.750 --> 33:24.710
I can't.

449
33:25.990 --> 33:27.270
I have plans with Saming.

450
33:28.460 --> 33:30.170
Why would you want to be with him?

451
33:30.200 --> 33:31.980
He's hurting you.

452
33:33.060 --> 33:34.720
He has never hurt me.

453
33:36.040 --> 33:37.310
You're the only one

454
33:37.900 --> 33:39.250
who's hurting both of us.

455
33:41.390 --> 33:42.590
I'm leaving.

456
34:09.050 --> 34:09.940
Hey.

457
34:11.290 --> 34:12.740
I need some help.

458
34:18.020 --> 34:19.150
Come on, cheers!

459
34:27.720 --> 34:29.370
Guys, Mungkorn is here.

460
34:29.520 --> 34:31.790
Hey, my brother! Come on in.

461
34:31.820 --> 34:32.600
Sit down.

462
34:32.630 --> 34:33.440
- Let's have a chat. - Hi.

463
34:33.470 --> 34:34.780
- Take a seat. - Come on.

464
34:36.590 --> 34:38.170
Why did we have to meet up today?

465
34:38.860 --> 34:40.680
Well, it's a Friday night!

466
34:40.710 --> 34:43.120
We've got to have some fun.

467
34:43.490 --> 34:45.620
I'll mix drinks for both of you.

468
34:48.550 --> 34:49.980
I don't have a problem with it,

469
34:50.630 --> 34:52.690
but I haven't even said yes.

470
34:52.970 --> 34:54.770
And somehow he made me come here.

471
35:03.180 --> 35:05.130
Besides, I haven't told Saming yet.

472
35:05.670 --> 35:08.020
We told Inspector Thear to bring you here.

473
35:08.380 --> 35:10.410
Since you've been acting strange,

474
35:10.610 --> 35:12.760
we wanted to spend more time with you.

475
35:12.910 --> 35:15.630
Or have you forgotten about us already?

476
35:16.130 --> 35:18.910
Exactly, especially after all we've been through together.

477
35:19.110 --> 35:20.460
I haven't.

478
35:21.330 --> 35:22.350
I remember everything.

479
35:23.290 --> 35:26.130
Then why don't we put your memory to the test?

480
35:27.280 --> 35:30.020
Do you remember who my partner is?

481
35:30.260 --> 35:31.590
It's Phuwin, obviously.

482
35:32.170 --> 35:32.830
Correct.

483
35:32.850 --> 35:34.480
Hey, what about mine?

484
35:34.630 --> 35:36.520
Do you remember who my partner is?

485
35:40.200 --> 35:41.210
Do you even have one?

486
35:43.140 --> 35:44.140
Well, not yet.

487
35:44.520 --> 35:45.680
But I'm about to.

488
35:47.400 --> 35:48.540
Very soon.

489
35:50.430 --> 35:51.450
Now is not your time.

490
35:51.980 --> 35:54.790
Fine, that was too easy.

491
35:54.840 --> 35:56.460
Thear, ask him a question.

492
35:57.310 --> 35:58.370
Alright.

493
35:59.070 --> 36:01.300
Do you remember who your partner is?

494
36:10.310 --> 36:11.060
It's okay.

495
36:12.200 --> 36:13.600
Let's make it easier.

496
36:14.720 --> 36:16.000
Do you remember...

497
36:16.080 --> 36:19.420
what our first mission together was?

498
36:26.090 --> 36:28.600
The drug bust at a bar.

499
36:28.620 --> 36:30.220
- Whoa! - Hey!

500
36:30.390 --> 36:31.370
That's correct.

501
36:31.450 --> 36:32.600
What about the second mission?

502
36:32.620 --> 36:34.110
Remember where we went?

503
36:37.230 --> 36:40.590
The house of the Black Bull agent.

504
36:41.100 --> 36:42.600
- Whoa! - Hey!

505
36:43.110 --> 36:44.250
- There he goes. - He's getting it.

506
36:49.390 --> 36:51.370
Why are you all so happy?

507
36:51.510 --> 36:52.870
Of course they're happy.

508
36:53.060 --> 36:54.970
These are all memorable events.

509
36:54.990 --> 36:56.610
And do you remember...

510
36:56.920 --> 36:58.460
that you once got shot?

511
36:58.770 --> 36:59.460
Remember that?

512
37:04.420 --> 37:06.590
Back then, Inspector Thear

513
37:07.000 --> 37:09.350
stayed by your side until you were fully recovered.

514
37:11.400 --> 37:14.320
You know, he was worried sick about you.

515
37:39.400 --> 37:41.110
- It doesn't hurt too much, does it? - No, it's fine.

516
37:44.340 --> 37:47.230
I'm your love, Inspector Thear?

517
38:08.600 --> 38:09.590
Mungkorn...

518
38:16.530 --> 38:18.220
You're drinking without me?

519
38:18.260 --> 38:21.250
If you didn't get invited, it means you're not welcome here.

520
38:22.970 --> 38:24.070
Mungkorn,

521
38:24.540 --> 38:26.620
you didn't tell me you wanted to hang out like this.

522
38:26.680 --> 38:28.100
I'll bring you here next time.

523
38:28.220 --> 38:30.420
Let's come here together next time. Just you and me.

524
38:31.290 --> 38:32.200
Mungkorn.

525
38:33.120 --> 38:34.370
Come on, let's have some fun.

526
38:34.390 --> 38:35.470
The night is still young.

527
38:35.610 --> 38:36.260
Come on.

528
38:36.290 --> 38:37.200
Come on, Mungkorn.

529
38:37.220 --> 38:39.610
Fill up your glass. Let's drink.

530
38:40.120 --> 38:41.920
Wanna join us, Saming?

531
38:43.610 --> 38:44.460
Nah.

532
38:45.340 --> 38:47.390
I'd rather take you back home.

533
38:48.540 --> 38:51.370
I wish we could have some time to ourselves.

534
38:54.030 --> 38:55.990
Then let's go home.

535
38:57.080 --> 38:57.830
Alright.

536
38:58.910 --> 38:59.950
Let's go.

537
39:08.590 --> 39:09.510
Mungkorn!

538
39:12.700 --> 39:14.830
Hey! Let go of him!

539
39:17.680 --> 39:18.960
What is it with you now?

540
39:19.670 --> 39:20.840
He chose to come with me.

541
39:20.870 --> 39:22.400
What the hell does it have to do with you?

542
39:22.460 --> 39:25.030
How can you be so sure he chose you?

543
39:25.050 --> 39:27.600
You saw for yourself he was hanging out with his friends.

544
39:27.860 --> 39:29.650
Then why don't you ask him

545
39:29.870 --> 39:32.370
if he wants to be with his friends or with me?

546
39:35.300 --> 39:36.870
I'm leaving with Saming.

547
39:38.070 --> 39:39.270
You should just go.

548
39:39.560 --> 39:40.450
See?

549
39:40.890 --> 39:41.960
You heard him.

550
39:42.060 --> 39:44.200
Go drown your sorrows with your friends.

551
39:44.490 --> 39:46.150
I don't want any trouble,

552
39:46.370 --> 39:48.540
especially since your luck seems to be hitting rock bottom.

553
39:57.700 --> 39:58.850
I win.

554
39:59.960 --> 40:02.270
I'm taking Mungkorn for myself.

555
40:03.660 --> 40:06.660
Dammit, you f*cking played dirty.

556
40:10.420 --> 40:11.870
What the f*ck do you mean?

557
40:13.170 --> 40:14.260
Looking for a fight, huh?

558
40:15.190 --> 40:16.670
Leave Saming alone!

559
40:17.200 --> 40:18.140
Hey, stop.

560
40:18.170 --> 40:19.620
Thear, calm down!

561
40:21.940 --> 40:25.090
This is up to Mungkorn anyway, isn't it?

562
40:25.930 --> 40:28.210
You had someone precious but couldn't keep him,

563
40:28.230 --> 40:30.020
so I had to step in.

564
40:30.310 --> 40:31.750
- Got it? - Shut your damn mouth.

565
40:31.780 --> 40:32.770
- Thear! - Mungkorn!

566
40:32.800 --> 40:34.050
Don't go with him.

567
40:34.900 --> 40:36.970
Calm down. Let them go for now.

568
40:37.400 --> 40:39.480
Phuwin, keep an eye on your friend.

569
40:39.860 --> 40:42.550
He looks just like a dog chasing a motorcycle.

570
40:42.570 --> 40:45.510
- What the f*ck do you mean? - Thear, stop!

571
40:45.530 --> 40:46.520
Get a grip.

572
40:46.570 --> 40:49.870
Dammit, you piece of sh*t! F*ck you.

573
40:49.980 --> 40:50.820
Inspector!

574
40:51.470 --> 40:52.250
Take it easy.

575
40:52.270 --> 40:52.990
Calm down.

576
40:54.290 --> 40:55.000
Hey.

577
40:55.740 --> 40:56.550
Calm down.

578
40:56.670 --> 40:57.760
I've already handled it.

579
40:57.780 --> 40:59.630
I planted a GPS tracker on his car.

580
41:09.220 --> 41:14.510
(PM 5473 Phayao)

581
41:25.360 --> 41:28.750
(PM 5473 Phayao)

582
41:29.520 --> 41:30.990
Make yourself at home.

583
41:31.680 --> 41:34.130
Your house is huge and very lovely.

584
41:34.850 --> 41:37.880
No matter how huge it is, I still feel lonely.

585
41:38.730 --> 41:40.610
That's why I want someone to stay with me.

586
41:42.570 --> 41:43.200
Come on.

587
41:44.930 --> 41:46.310
Let me show you my bedroom.

588
41:59.490 --> 42:00.190
(KN 48051 Chiang Mai)

589
42:04.540 --> 42:06.850
Saming's trying to pull Mungkorn

590
42:06.870 --> 42:08.470
into whatever shady sh*t he's involved in.

591
42:08.590 --> 42:10.350
If he gets to sleep with Mungkorn tonight,

592
42:10.500 --> 42:12.090
I don't think things will end well for Mungkorn.

593
42:12.570 --> 42:13.710
What do you mean by that?

594
42:13.800 --> 42:16.990
Physical connection is actually a spiritual matter.

595
42:17.440 --> 42:20.650
Once they make physical contact, his black magic will be complete.

596
42:21.210 --> 42:22.090
Like...

597
42:22.120 --> 42:25.430
Oh, you mean the body, mind, and soul theory?

598
42:26.690 --> 42:29.130
Right now, the spell has only taken over Mungkorn's mind.

599
42:29.390 --> 42:31.440
But once it claims his body,

600
42:32.010 --> 42:33.620
his soul will belong to Saming.

601
42:33.820 --> 42:35.130
That was a very vivid explanation.

602
42:35.200 --> 42:36.750
Then let's figure out

603
42:36.880 --> 42:38.910
how to stop them from sleeping together.

604
42:43.250 --> 42:46.310
Phuwin and Lukplub, you go cut the power to his house.

605
42:46.820 --> 42:49.020
I doubt they can do much if the lights are out.

606
42:49.200 --> 42:51.260
- Okay. - You got it. We'll handle that.

607
42:51.280 --> 42:52.520
And after the lights go out?

608
42:52.950 --> 42:55.110
Just barge in and get him out of there?

609
42:55.440 --> 42:56.440
No.

610
42:57.450 --> 43:00.030
I'll try to make him remember one more time.

611
43:00.050 --> 43:01.040
But you've already tried that.

612
43:01.070 --> 43:02.160
It didn't work, did it?

613
43:02.180 --> 43:03.330
I'm not giving up.

614
43:03.680 --> 43:06.150
I'll never let that bastard take Mungkorn away from me.

615
43:09.300 --> 43:10.330
- Let's go. - Okay.

616
43:28.590 --> 43:29.580
After you.

617
43:41.540 --> 43:44.990
It's finally just you and me.

618
43:46.380 --> 43:48.930
Things were getting in the way at the bar.

619
43:49.550 --> 43:51.800
We barely got a moment alone.

620
43:54.140 --> 43:55.150
And...

621
43:56.830 --> 43:58.670
does it hurt a lot?

622
43:59.660 --> 44:00.570
Not at all.

623
44:01.910 --> 44:03.060
It was more than worth it

624
44:03.720 --> 44:05.760
to have you right here with me.

625
44:19.500 --> 44:20.790
Can I ask you something?

626
44:21.600 --> 44:22.640
What is it?

627
44:23.230 --> 44:24.910
Do you love Thear?

628
44:25.950 --> 44:27.290
Why do you ask?

629
44:28.810 --> 44:30.960
I want to know why you married him

630
44:31.940 --> 44:33.910
and how you feel about him.

631
44:35.540 --> 44:36.820
Do you love him?

632
44:38.450 --> 44:39.980
I married him

633
44:41.280 --> 44:43.140
purely for what I would get in return.

634
44:43.990 --> 44:45.320
For me,

635
44:45.890 --> 44:48.390
you're the one I actually have feelings for.

636
44:52.300 --> 44:54.030
I feel the same way about you.

637
44:56.280 --> 44:57.080
Mungkorn...

638
44:57.740 --> 44:58.490
Yes?

639
44:58.810 --> 45:00.010
Divorce him.

640
45:01.830 --> 45:03.140
From now on,

641
45:03.560 --> 45:04.920
just tell me what you want,

642
45:05.340 --> 45:06.920
and I'll give you everything.

643
45:09.300 --> 45:10.520
Yes, Saming.

644
45:29.000 --> 45:30.310
Take the shirt off.

645
45:36.250 --> 45:37.710
I meant your shirt.

646
46:56.550 --> 46:58.150
You check this side. I'll handle that one.

647
46:58.180 --> 46:58.850
Got it.

648
47:25.560 --> 47:26.520
Looks like a power outage.

649
47:28.810 --> 47:30.020
Stay right here.

650
47:31.280 --> 47:32.150
I'll be right back.

651
47:39.480 --> 47:40.280
Let's go.

652
47:49.840 --> 47:50.980
Where should we hide?

653
47:52.290 --> 47:53.010
Come here.

654
47:54.240 --> 47:54.990
Come on.

655
49:22.730 --> 49:24.450
A candle is a nice touch.

656
49:25.210 --> 49:26.640
It makes this more romantic.

657
49:27.260 --> 49:27.940
Alright.

658
49:28.390 --> 49:29.720
Let's pick up where we left off.

659
49:49.370 --> 49:54.610
♪I have a heart to give, when will you receive it?♪

660
49:55.400 --> 49:59.290
♪Can you hear it? My love, can you hear my wishes?♪

661
49:59.310 --> 50:01.620
Who the hell is playing music this late at night?

662
50:01.640 --> 50:07.070
♪All of my heart, I've kept it all for you,♪

663
50:07.500 --> 50:12.680
♪And all I want is for it to belong to you♪

664
50:15.900 --> 50:21.190
♪If you ask how much I love you, I'll let you know♪

665
50:21.240 --> 50:26.440
♪If you ask how much I care, I'll tell you so♪

666
50:26.460 --> 50:31.740
♪I love you to the moon and back♪

667
50:31.760 --> 50:36.540
♪That's how much love I have packed♪

668
50:36.920 --> 50:43.130
♪About four hundred thousand miles, or even more than that♪

669
50:48.280 --> 50:50.360
I'm going to take that song you just played

670
50:50.520 --> 50:53.190
as our love confession.

671
51:10.700 --> 51:18.670
♪If you ask how much I love you, I'll let you know♪

672
51:18.700 --> 51:24.400
♪If you ask how much I care, I'll tell you so♪

673
51:25.100 --> 51:30.040
♪I love you to the moon and back♪

674
51:30.300 --> 51:31.100
Mungkorn...

675
51:33.630 --> 51:35.060
What's wrong? Tell me.

676
51:37.030 --> 51:37.870
Mungkorn?

677
51:38.650 --> 51:39.820
Why are you putting your shirt back on?

678
51:40.710 --> 51:41.940
Where are you going?

679
51:42.920 --> 51:44.460
Aren't you staying the night with me?

680
51:46.550 --> 51:48.440
I have to go home.

681
51:49.750 --> 51:52.440
I have a headache, and I'm not feeling very well.

682
51:54.940 --> 51:56.330
Wait a second.

683
51:58.020 --> 52:00.210
We haven't even had any fun yet.

684
52:00.270 --> 52:01.430
Let's not do it.

685
52:01.510 --> 52:03.130
Come on, Mungkorn.

686
52:03.410 --> 52:05.230
- Stay and have some fun with me. - Saming...

687
52:05.250 --> 52:07.080
- I really want to go home. - Come on.

688
52:07.110 --> 52:08.450
Mungkorn, don't leave.

689
52:08.470 --> 52:10.370
Saming, I want to go home.

690
52:12.990 --> 52:13.860
Mungkorn!

691
52:24.190 --> 52:25.160
Mungkorn!

692
52:26.780 --> 52:27.790
Mungkorn, wait!

693
52:29.050 --> 52:30.020
Let me give you a ride.

694
52:30.040 --> 52:31.040
It's okay.

695
52:31.080 --> 52:32.550
- But... - I'll get a ride home myself.

696
52:32.580 --> 52:34.440
But it's late now.

697
52:34.730 --> 52:36.650
- Let me give you a ride. - I said I'm fine!

698
53:01.390 --> 53:02.330
Need a ride?

699
53:03.950 --> 53:04.610
Yes.

700
53:15.630 --> 53:16.640
Thank you.

701
54:34.280 --> 54:35.590
You look worried.

702
54:35.970 --> 54:37.010
Are you okay?

703
54:37.230 --> 54:38.260
I'm kinda worried.

704
54:38.660 --> 54:40.890
I have no idea what trick Inspector Saming is going to pull next.

705
54:41.420 --> 54:43.100
I should have been able to save Mungkorn,

706
54:43.360 --> 54:44.860
given everything I knew.

707
54:47.340 --> 54:49.380
I suspect that Saming...

708
54:50.210 --> 54:52.130
is working with the Black Bull.

709
54:53.310 --> 54:54.810
What makes you think that?

710
54:55.980 --> 54:59.050
It all started when we were interrogating Tiannan.

711
54:59.420 --> 55:00.520
I just don't understand

712
55:00.550 --> 55:03.930
why he gave up the intel to Saming so easily.

713
55:05.040 --> 55:07.130
But putting yourself in that kind of relationship...

714
55:07.630 --> 55:09.140
is extremely risky.

715
55:11.420 --> 55:12.310
I know.

716
55:12.750 --> 55:15.340
That's why I'm giving you this scrapbook.

717
55:16.210 --> 55:17.370
If anything happens,

718
55:18.030 --> 55:19.780
please give it to Inspector Thear.

719
55:22.970 --> 55:23.860
Take it easy.

720
55:24.990 --> 55:26.500
We're working on this together.

721
55:27.460 --> 55:29.520
Mungkorn will definitely be one of us again.

722
55:44.760 --> 55:47.400
Are you wearing the amulet I gave you?

723
55:48.950 --> 55:49.770
Of course I am.

724
55:50.620 --> 55:53.850
I always do whatever you tell me to.

725
55:55.510 --> 55:57.980
But I think our plan for today is solid.

726
55:58.360 --> 55:59.730
Nothing's going to go wrong.

727
56:01.880 --> 56:03.480
I'm not so sure.

728
56:04.000 --> 56:05.500
We also had a good plan last time,

729
56:05.750 --> 56:07.730
but Mungkorn ended up getting shot.

730
56:08.670 --> 56:10.120
Physical protection is one thing,

731
56:10.500 --> 56:12.260
but having an amulet for spiritual protection is good, too.

732
56:14.730 --> 56:18.640
You know, if anyone ever tried to put a love spell on you,

733
56:20.660 --> 56:22.140
I wouldn't be able to stand it.

734
56:24.770 --> 56:25.950
Don't you worry.

735
56:26.590 --> 56:27.510
It wouldn't work anyway.

736
56:28.420 --> 56:31.150
I'm so under your spell that nobody else can touch me.

737
56:36.490 --> 56:39.130
Anyway, where is Mungkorn?

738
56:39.150 --> 56:40.240
Didn't you two come together?

739
56:40.370 --> 56:41.720
He should be here soon.

740
56:42.350 --> 56:43.380
Is something the matter?

741
56:43.410 --> 56:45.540
You two have been acting strange lately.

742
56:47.500 --> 56:49.590
Someone came between us and caused a misunderstanding.

743
56:52.990 --> 56:53.820
Oh, Sin!

744
56:53.910 --> 56:55.040
Have a seat here.

745
56:55.130 --> 56:57.050
- Good evening, sir. - Hello. Have a seat.

746
56:57.270 --> 56:58.130
Thank you.

747
56:59.710 --> 57:01.350
Happy birthday, sir.

748
57:01.370 --> 57:04.150
May you live for a hundred million years.

749
57:04.580 --> 57:06.540
Whoa, I don't need all those years.

750
57:06.570 --> 57:08.340
I'd be struggling just to get by at a hundred.

751
57:08.520 --> 57:10.430
- Come on, cheers. - Thank you, sir.

752
57:13.750 --> 57:14.660
Thear,

753
57:15.160 --> 57:17.080
regarding what you reported to me,

754
57:17.220 --> 57:18.510
you can make your move.

755
57:18.800 --> 57:21.150
Understood. I won't let anything go wrong.

756
57:21.600 --> 57:24.290
Just be extra careful this time.

757
57:24.550 --> 57:26.570
You guys almost got killed last time.

758
57:32.870 --> 57:35.000
Oh, Mungkorn is here.

759
57:40.080 --> 57:42.460
Wait, isn't that your friend?

760
57:42.490 --> 57:43.670
I remember him.

761
57:44.120 --> 57:45.220
Inspector Saming, right?

762
57:45.630 --> 57:46.650
Yes, Mom.

763
57:47.190 --> 57:48.440
But he's no friend.

764
57:48.760 --> 57:49.560
He's an enemy.

765
57:49.680 --> 57:50.520
What?

766
57:51.620 --> 57:53.050
What happened, son?

767
57:54.980 --> 57:56.880
Why is he arm-in-arm with Mungkorn like that?

768
57:57.010 --> 57:59.040
Why does Mr. Mungkorn look so drained?

769
57:59.320 --> 58:01.290
And why isn't he here with you?

770
58:02.230 --> 58:03.370
Don't worry, Mom.

771
58:04.710 --> 58:06.960
He'll be back with me no matter what.

772
58:12.160 --> 58:14.130
You didn't answer my calls last night.

773
58:14.580 --> 58:16.230
I was worried sick about you.

774
58:16.750 --> 58:17.910
I'm fine.

775
58:18.480 --> 58:20.220
Last night didn't go as planned.

776
58:21.540 --> 58:22.950
Let's find another chance.

777
58:23.160 --> 58:23.840
Please.

778
58:24.980 --> 58:25.760
Hey.

779
58:27.130 --> 58:29.110
Or you could just move in with me.

780
58:29.720 --> 58:31.480
That'd make things easier, wouldn't it?

781
58:31.620 --> 58:33.120
Who the hell invited you?

782
58:37.170 --> 58:38.520
Have some manners.

783
58:39.110 --> 58:41.050
This is your dad's birthday party.

784
58:42.050 --> 58:43.150
You can't act like a thug

785
58:43.170 --> 58:45.060
and punch me like you did at the bar.

786
58:46.330 --> 58:47.840
Show some respect for your family.

787
58:48.400 --> 58:49.900
Don't you dare lecture me.

788
58:50.660 --> 58:52.960
I know exactly what I'm doing,

789
58:53.040 --> 58:55.550
and I know exactly what you're doing, too.

790
58:56.500 --> 58:58.420
But I bet you don't know...

791
58:59.170 --> 59:01.140
that he's moving in with me.

792
59:02.340 --> 59:03.530
Is that true, Mungkorn?

793
59:04.480 --> 59:05.970
Well, he asked me to.

794
59:07.040 --> 59:08.160
His house is huge.

795
59:09.680 --> 59:11.220
Things would be easier, too.

796
59:11.550 --> 59:12.250
But...

797
59:12.270 --> 59:14.840
Can't you just respect his decision for once?

798
59:17.110 --> 59:18.100
Right, Mungkorn?

799
59:18.910 --> 59:19.590
Yes.

800
59:38.470 --> 59:39.960
Alright, everyone.

801
59:39.980 --> 59:41.500
Moving on to the next part.

802
59:41.530 --> 59:43.520
I'd like to express our gratitude

803
59:43.540 --> 59:46.870
to all the officers and their spouses here.

804
59:46.890 --> 59:51.120
Thank you for joining us to celebrate

805
59:51.150 --> 59:55.460
Police General Panya's 72nd birthday. He's already retired.

806
59:58.760 --> 01:00:01.890
Now, I'd like Police Major Thear to come up on stage

807
01:00:01.920 --> 01:00:04.630
and offer his wishes to Police General Panya.

808
01:00:04.660 --> 01:00:09.480
(Police General Panya Phiromsamorn)

809
01:00:17.420 --> 01:00:18.980
Good evening, everyone.

810
01:00:19.250 --> 01:00:21.330
First of all, I'd like to thank all of you

811
01:00:21.360 --> 01:00:24.490
for coming to celebrate my father's birthday.

812
01:00:24.880 --> 01:00:26.980
Now, I'd like to give my father my best wishes.

813
01:00:28.140 --> 01:00:31.390
Dad, I wish you great health and strength

814
01:00:31.410 --> 01:00:33.320
so you can stay with me, Mom,

815
01:00:33.440 --> 01:00:36.220
and all our family and colleagues for a long time to come.

816
01:00:42.590 --> 01:00:43.920
And everyone,

817
01:00:44.170 --> 01:00:46.710
today isn't just about celebrating my father's birthday.

818
01:00:46.770 --> 01:00:49.750
I'd also like to officially introduce my life partner

819
01:00:49.780 --> 01:00:51.160
to all of you.

820
01:00:56.980 --> 01:00:58.110
Sergeant Mungkorn,

821
01:00:58.600 --> 01:00:59.450
come up here.

822
01:01:05.150 --> 01:01:05.890
Mungkorn,

823
01:01:06.320 --> 01:01:07.150
go on.

824
01:01:10.930 --> 01:01:11.990
Go up there.

825
01:01:15.530 --> 01:01:16.960
Can I get a round of applause, please?

826
01:01:26.290 --> 01:01:27.200
Ladies and gentlemen, meet...

827
01:01:28.000 --> 01:01:30.140
Pol.Snr.Sgt.Maj. Mungkorn Phianwanich.

828
01:01:34.230 --> 01:01:37.010
He is my legally wedded husband.

829
01:01:37.740 --> 01:01:38.740
Since when were they married?

830
01:01:42.200 --> 01:01:44.250
We have been married for a while now,

831
01:01:44.270 --> 01:01:46.770
but I haven't had the chance to officially announce it.

832
01:01:46.840 --> 01:01:48.210
So tonight,

833
01:01:48.400 --> 01:01:50.970
I'd like to ask you to wish us

834
01:01:51.000 --> 01:01:53.490
a happy life together with nothing standing in our way.

835
01:01:55.210 --> 01:01:57.480
May you all be witnesses to our promise

836
01:01:57.510 --> 01:01:58.660
to love

837
01:01:59.180 --> 01:02:01.070
and cherish each other forever.

838
01:02:05.230 --> 01:02:07.540
And no one will ever come between us

839
01:02:07.750 --> 01:02:10.440
or tear us apart.

840
01:02:43.650 --> 01:02:44.850
Don't do anything to Mungkorn.

841
01:02:44.870 --> 01:02:45.890
Just take it out on me.

842
01:02:47.370 --> 01:02:48.670
Saming, stop!

843
01:02:51.000 --> 01:02:52.000
Please...

844
01:02:52.030 --> 01:02:53.390
I'll do anything for you.

845
01:02:53.410 --> 01:02:55.440
I'll even marry you if that's what you want.

846
01:02:55.470 --> 01:02:57.920
I told you. You'll never beat me.

847
01:03:02.090 --> 01:03:07.000
♪Trying so hard not to cross the line,♪

848
01:03:07.030 --> 01:03:11.860
♪But the more I run, the more you're on my mind♪

849
01:03:11.880 --> 01:03:16.150
♪If you're gonna love me, don't break the deal we made♪

850
01:03:16.180 --> 01:03:21.700
♪Don't break my heart, remember what you said?♪

851
01:03:21.730 --> 01:03:26.600
♪Let's call off the deal and let our hearts decide♪

852
01:03:26.630 --> 01:03:33.060
♪From contracting parties to lovers, does that sound alright?♪

853
01:03:39.300 --> 01:03:42.690
♪It's time you became mine♪

854
01:03:42.690 --> 01:03:43.690
MkvDrama.net
